{
    "id": "gid://shopify/Product/15756753305760",
    "title": "Arduino Robotics Kit",
    "body_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Unlock the world of robotics, electronics, and programming with the KiddyPi Arduino Robotics Kit. Designed for students aged 9 years and above, this comprehensive STEM learning kit enables learners to build over 50 exciting projects while mastering the fundamentals of electronics, automation, sensors, robotics, and Arduino programming.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Whether you're a beginner taking your first step into robotics or a young innovator looking to build advanced projects, this kit provides everything needed to learn through hands-on experimentation. Students will work with real-world sensors, motors, displays, communication modules, and robotic components while learning how microcontrollers power modern technology.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The kit includes the powerful Arduino Uno R3, multiple sensors, motors, Bluetooth communication, LCD display, motor drivers, robotic chassis, wheels, batteries, and the exclusive KiddyPi Add-on Board to simplify project development and accelerate learning.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Through project-based STEM learning, students develop creativity, computational thinking, engineering design skills, and problem-solving abilities while gaining practical experience in coding and electronics.</span></p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span>What Students Will Learn</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Arduino Programming Fundamentals</span></li>\n<li><span>C++ Programming for Embedded Systems</span></li>\n<li><span>Electronics and Circuit Design</span></li>\n<li><span>Sensor Integration and Calibration</span></li>\n<li><span>Robotics and Automation Concepts</span></li>\n<li><span>Motor Control Techniques</span></li>\n<li><span>Wireless Communication using Bluetooth</span></li>\n<li><span>Display Programming with LCD Screens</span></li>\n<li><span>Data Collection and Environmental Monitoring</span></li>\n<li><span>Engineering Design Thinking</span></li>\n<li><span>Problem Solving and Logical Reasoning</span></li>\n<li><span>Real-world Product Development</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span>50+ Projects Include</span></h3>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Beginner Projects</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span>LED Blinker</span></li>\n<li><span>Electronic Dice</span></li>\n<li><span>Traffic Light Controller</span></li>\n<li><span>Smart Night Lamp</span></li>\n<li><span>Digital Buzzer Alarm</span></li>\n<li><span>Push Button Interface</span></li>\n<li><span>PWM LED Brightness Control</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Intermediate Projects</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Distance Measurement System</span></li>\n<li><span>Obstacle Detection Robot</span></li>\n<li><span>Temperature &amp; Humidity Monitor</span></li>\n<li><span>LCD Information Display</span></li>\n<li><span>Motion Detection System</span></li>\n<li><span>Ultrasonic Parking Sensor</span></li>\n<li><span>Bluetooth-Controlled LED</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Advanced Projects</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Bluetooth-Controlled Robot Car</span></li>\n<li><span>Obstacle Avoidance Robot</span></li>\n<li><span>Smart Environmental Monitoring Station</span></li>\n<li><span>Home Automation Prototype</span></li>\n<li><span>Autonomous Rover</span></li>\n<li><span>Security Alert System</span></li>\n<li><span>IoT-Ready Robotics Projects</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>And 50+ guided experiments covering robotics, automation, sensing, and embedded programming.</span></p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span>What's Included</span></h3>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Controller &amp; Development Boards</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Arduino Uno R3 (DIP Version)</span></li>\n<li><span>KiddyPi Add-on Board</span></li>\n<li><span>USB Programming Cable</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Electronics Components</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Breadboard (800 Points)</span></li>\n<li><span>Assorted Resistor Box</span></li>\n<li><span>Push Buttons</span></li>\n<li><span>LEDs (Red, Yellow, Green, White)</span></li>\n<li><span>Buzzer</span></li>\n<li><span>Male Berg Sticks</span></li>\n<li><span>IC Base</span></li>\n<li><span>L293D Motor Driver IC</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Sensors</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span>IR Sensors</span></li>\n<li><span>Ultrasonic Sensor (HC-SR04)</span></li>\n<li><span>DHT11 Temperature &amp; Humidity Sensor</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Displays &amp; Communication</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>LCD 16x2 Display with I2C Module</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Bluetooth Module HC-05</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Motors &amp; Robotics Components</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Servo Motor SG90</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>BO Motors</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>BO Wheels</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Chassis</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Metal Caster Wheel</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>L298N Motor Driver</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Power Components</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>18650 Li-Ion Battery</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>2 Cell Battery Holder</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Battery Charger</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>9V Battery</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>9V Battery Connector</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Connectors &amp; Accessories</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Jumper Wires (M-M, M-F, F-F)</span></li>\n<li><span>RMC Connectors</span></li>\n<li><span>Barrel Jack Connector</span></li>\n<li><span>Screw Driver</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Why Choose the KiddyPi Arduino Robotics Kit?</span></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Build 50+ STEM and Robotics Projects</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Learn Real Arduino Programming in C++</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Includes Robotics Hardware and Electronics Components</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Develop Engineering and Problem-Solving Skills</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Suitable for Home Learning, Schools, and STEM Labs</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Beginner to Advanced Learning Path</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Exclusive KiddyPi Add-on Board Included</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Supports Robotics Competitions and Innovation Challenges</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\u2714 Industry-Relevant Hardware and Programming Concepts</span></p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Ideal For</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Students (9+ Years)</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Robotics Enthusiasts</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>STEM Learning Programs</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>School Innovation Labs</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Science Exhibitions</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Robotics Competitions</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Makers and Hobbyists</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Arduino Beginners</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Product Highlights</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>50+ Hands-on Robotics &amp; Electronics Projects</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Learn Arduino Programming with C++</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Build and Program Your Own Robot Car</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Bluetooth-Controlled Robotics Projects</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Includes Sensors, Motors, LCD &amp; Communication Modules</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Exclusive KiddyPi Add-on Board</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Suitable for Beginners and Advanced Learners</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Ideal for STEM Labs, Schools and Home Learning</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Complete Robotics Learning Ecosystem</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Designed for Ages 9+ Years</span></li>\n</ul>",
